# Naming

- `camelCase` — functions, variables, hooks (`useDebounce.ts`)
- `PascalCase` — React components and their folders (`UserCard/UserCard.tsx`)
- `kebab-case` — non-component folders and assets (`user-profile/`, `arrow-right.svg`)

Component files: `ComponentName.tsx`, `ComponentName.test.ts`, optional `.types.ts` / `.constants.ts`.
Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/NAMING.md`
